{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在各種意義上都算養足了精神，然後來到了決勝負的星期日。", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "必須在明天早上前完成這個蛋糕。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，帶著過夜用品來學校，好不可思議的感覺喔……」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2921", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是的，我們已經做好今晚通宵的覺悟了。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家今天也是這麼打算才來的吧。」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，就好像文化祭之類的活動前一晚呢。」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2922", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「像結女這樣的大小姐學校，在這種時候也會有人睡在學校嗎？」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是因為是這種時候啊。」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2923", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且蘭華小姐也會當作沒看見。跟安潔一起偷偷地巡視大家呢。」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2924", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，原來如此，可以想像得到那個畫面。」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過今天不用裝作沒看到，因為已經取得許可了。」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "剛才出門前，已經打電話給學園長告知今天可能會過夜了。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長接到電話後，很爽快就同意了。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過只講了兩句話就掛電話，她還是這麼忙呢。", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這下子得做出讓學園長也驚訝的蛋糕了。」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個人標準很高嘛～必須要付出相當大的心力才行。」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2925", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔笑嘻嘻的，真的很開心的樣子。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "應該是期待今天吧。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當然接下來重頭戲的明天也是。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那走吧，安潔。」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的，主人。」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2926", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們談笑著穿過校門。", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不過，距離其他人來還有一點時間。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們沒有直接去料理實習室，而是在空無一人的走廊上稍微閒晃了一下。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……咦？」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當我注意到的時候，身邊的安潔消失了。", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔？」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我以為呼喚之後她會從天花板上出現，但實際上只聽見自己的聲音在回響。", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的……」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我走到別的地方。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好久沒這樣到處找安潔了。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈。」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想起之前這麼做的時候，當時的愉快又湧上心頭。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……找到了。」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、主人！」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2927", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在安潔以前住的房間找到她了。", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對不起，忍不住就……」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2928", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒關係，我找到妳了。」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好久沒來這裡了呢。」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的……話雖如此，其實也只是一個月前事情。」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2929", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我環視房間。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和之前一模一樣。", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔來我們家之後，這裡就沒有人在用吧……？」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔是這樣聽說的。不過安潔有時候會來打掃……」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2930", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她摸了摸榻榻米。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "非常珍惜的的感覺，這裡對她來說有很多回憶吧。", "text_idx": 499, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……真的，還是一模一樣。」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2931", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「像花瓣一樣。」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2932", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之前來拜訪這個房間的時候，我總是這麼想。」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔在榻榻米上跪坐的時候裙子會鋪開，簡直就像花瓣一樣。」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……成為主人的女僕之後，也沒有改變嗎？」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2933", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「從那個時候開始，就一直覺得安潔很可愛了。」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又在奇怪的時機說這種話……」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2934", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，抱歉抱歉。」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是看到沒有改變的裙子花瓣，我的心跳不可思議地加快也是事實。", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "與她結合前的心動的感覺，現在依然能輕易地想起來。", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔再次摸了摸榻榻米。", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……雖然感覺已經過去很久了，不過在這裡生活還是不久前的事。」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2935", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然和現在的安潔是相連的呢，主人。」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2936", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為有那些日子，所以才有現在。", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "已經可以如此肯定地說了。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……所以，必須回報才行。」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是。」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2937", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔露出從容的微笑。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這份從容也是因為「現在」而存在。", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不好意思，主人。現在去料理實習室吧！」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2938", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們到料理實習室不久後，其他人也陸陸續續前來了。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說……好像比星期五的人數更多了……」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、那個～新來的各位同學，真的可以嗎……？」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2939", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "結女生徒３年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，這種事不參加太可惜了吧！」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結女學生3年級", "alt_speaker_idx": 481, "voice": "jt0002", "char_id": "結女生徒３年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我們會工作的，安潔學姊！」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "結女學生1年級", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "jo0003", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "星期五時沒有參加的人也都紛紛贊同。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然趕不上現在這個時間，但是好像有很多人稍後也會過來喔。」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "結女學生1年級", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "jo0004", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……真的很謝謝各位！」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2940", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼那麼，跟安潔一起做蛋糕吧！」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2941", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好！」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "結女學生1年級", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "jo0005", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔，安潔好像老師喔……我感覺自己沒有立場了……」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "mc0225", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不不不，沒有那種事啦！」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天連萬智老師都來了。", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「領導……應該說監督吧？總之很謝謝老師妳來。」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這、這個嘛，畢竟這麼多學生在假日集合，不但會用火甚至還要過夜，老師不得不來看看啊。」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "mc0226", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是說啊，嗯，很感謝妳！」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……因為接到學園長的電話告訴我這些，所以我才來當監督的。唉，再見了我的假日……」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "mc0227", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過，連假日也可以見到新吾君，算是一點小獎勵吧……嗯～今天也好可愛……」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "mc0228", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最後這句我就當作沒聽到好了。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然已經說了會晚到，但是請快點來支援吧，隼太！", "text_idx": 498, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼要從什麼事情開始，安潔？」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "ar4124", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打生奶油嗎？」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "sk1039", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，生奶油晚一點再做吧。還有，生奶油大概打８分稠就可以了。」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2942", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學和櫻乃當然也來了。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "對瀨名同學來說，假日是可以排打工的重要時間，卻還是願意來學校幫忙我們，太感謝了。", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早啊～我來了喔！」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sn0397", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天我也來了喔。小熊喵留在家裡看家了。」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "mu0438", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，該不會還沒開始？原來我趕得及嘛～」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ht0391", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其他人也都抵達了。", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「首先要做本體的海綿蛋糕嗎？」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ja0077", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「正是如此。因為是大型的蛋糕，所以這部分非常重要。」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2943", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「模具由安潔來處理，各位請分頭開始準備麵團吧～」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2944", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "汎用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔～～～～！！」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "學生全員", "alt_speaker_idx": 448, "voice": "go074", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就這樣，為了明天我們一群人鬥志高昂地開始製作蛋糕了。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家熱熱鬧鬧地分工合作，不分年級和性別。", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔～蛋黃已經打成緞帶狀了喔！」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "結女學生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 483, "voice": "jb0036", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瞭解。等蛋白準備好後就可以混合了。」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2945", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「麵粉的量真驚人……這樣光是撒下去就很累了。」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "sa0046", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「待會安潔會去幫忙，在那之前請再稍微堅持一下！」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2946", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿咻！我把模具都拿來了。」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 437, "voice": "da0054", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝你！安潔之後會確認的。」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2947", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔在教室裡東奔西跑，今天也是搖晃著裙襬指揮大局。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且不只是指揮。", "text_idx": 491, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔……手痠了……」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "sk1040", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也就是說該安潔出場了呢！」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2948", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「必殺！不輸給電動攪拌器的安潔攪拌～～！」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2949", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……為什麼在旁邊用著電動攪拌的我，認真地覺得輸了。」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "ar4125", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好厲害……要吃什麼才能變成那樣呢？」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "結女學生1年級", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "jo0006", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「硬要說的話就是愛情吧……」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2950", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「開玩笑的啦！啊哈哈！」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2951", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她大方地施展技術，一旁的同學們都佩服得不得了。", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「很好安潔，跟我一決勝負吧！電動攪拌器和手動作業，我是不會輸給妳的！」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sn0398", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，現在這個階段就已經輸了吧。」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 497, "voice": "ht0392", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「吵死了你這隻渣蟲，給我閉嘴站旁邊看！」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sn0399", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小紗凪，在料理食物的時候不可以說那種話喔！」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "mu0439", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之上吧上吧～安潔跟紗凪～」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ja0078", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我賭安潔好了。」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也是！」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 438, "voice": "db0034", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也是！」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "jc0064", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也是～」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "結女學生1年級", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "jo0007", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「給我等一下！？」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "sn0400", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵。」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2952", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "兩人的行動讓教室裡熱絡了起來──", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇哇，不知不覺就到晚上了！」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 494, "voice": "mc0229", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接下來才是重頭戲喔！差不多要烤海綿蛋糕了。」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2953", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為沒辦法直接烤出整個本體，所以要分段烤。然後把烤好的部分組合起來調整形狀。」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之後才終於是塗抹奶油啊……真的路還很漫長的感覺呢。」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "ar4126", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼唔……」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "結女學生1年級", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "jo0008", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「睡著了！這女孩睡著了！」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 482, "voice": "ja0079", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請大家都先小睡一會吧！烤好後安潔會負責搬的。」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2954", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，那種事就交給男生吧！還有安潔才是，妳趁這機會睡一下。」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 468, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀啊～～～～♪」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "女子一同", "alt_speaker_idx": 443, "voice": "go075", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥，好有主人的感覺。」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 473, "voice": "sk1041", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，明明沒有睡著，安潔好像置身在夢境裡一樣～」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2955", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "蛋糕製作持續到深夜──", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而這個夜晚，也迎來了黎明。", "text_idx": 492, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好了！」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag2956", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
